# Untracked build-context leftovers that were being baked into every image by the
# blanket `COPY packages/ ./packages/` and `COPY fluxer_server/ ...` in fluxer_server/Dockerfile.
# None held a live credential (the stray fluxer_server/config.json is a local-dev file), but
# shipping stale configs, test reports and database files into a production image is needless
# surface. Found by the 2026-07-31 post-deploy audit.
**/test-results.json
/fluxer_server/config.json
/fluxer_server/data
/packages/marketing/site.zip
!fluxer_app/dist
!fluxer_app/dist/**
fluxer_app/dist/**/*.map
!fluxer_devops/cassandra/migrations
